Z||000001||DJRice||01-24-2001||09:15 PM||||You should post stuff like this in the off-topic section.  But, to answer your question, You dont have the image file name included in your signature.  <P>According to the source code you have:<P><B><I>[img src ="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads"]</B></I><P>and you should have:<BR><B><I>[img src="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysignature.jpg"]</B></I><P>where <B><I>mysignature.jpg</B></I> is the file name of the image you want people to see.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
